WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:01.960
Hi there!

2
00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:03.321
[s@Hi there!

3
00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:04.081
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.281 --> 00:00:06.102
I'm an ostrich.

5
00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:11.104
I'm the biggest bird in the world.

6
00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:13.986
Where do you live?

7
00:00:15.206 --> 00:00:16.147
We live in Africa.

8
00:00:29.928 --> 00:00:32.649
We like the savanna and the desert.

9
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.591
Do you have wings?

10
00:00:37.051 --> 00:00:38.912
Yes. We have wings.

11
00:00:40.813 --> 00:00:42.534
But we can't fly.

12
00:00:42.554 --> 00:00:46.896
We can run very fast though.

13
00:00:54.499 --> 00:00:56.320
Your legs look strong.

14
00:00:57.388 --> 00:01:00.010
Ostriches' legs are very strong.

15
00:01:01.331 --> 00:01:03.352
We can kick enemies with them.

16
00:01:05.213 --> 00:01:07.195
Our feet have sharp claws.

17
00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:11.057
What do you eat?

18
00:01:13.279 --> 00:01:14.580
We eat plants.

19
00:01:16.341 --> 00:01:18.262
We get water from them too.

20
00:01:19.703 --> 00:01:22.645
Sometimes we eat bugs or lizards.

21
00:01:24.807 --> 00:01:25.847
Do you live in a herd?

22
00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:33.183
Yes. One male ostrich is in charge.

23
00:01:34.764 --> 00:01:37.345
Females put all their eggs together.

24
00:01:37.365 --> 00:01:42.388
Do ostriches stick their heads in the ground?

25
00:01:44.129 --> 00:01:49.612
No. We just put our heads near the ground.

26
00:01:50.872 --> 00:01:52.873
That helps us hide from enemies.

27
00:01:55.775 --> 00:01:57.276
Oh, I see a lion!

28
00:01:58.537 --> 00:01:59.298
See you later.

29
00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:02.143
Bye, Ostrich!
